    {
      "id": "l1",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Promises vs profit guarantees",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Promises vs profit guarantees"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/1-obietnice-a-gwarancje-zysku.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "These two words sound similar but mean something completely different:"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**Guarantee** – a legally binding commitment, e.g. a deposit or government bonds. Deposits in the EU are protected by a guarantee scheme up to **100,000 €**",
                "**Promise** – just a forecast, e.g. “this ETF grew 8% a year on average”. Past results **give no certainty** about the future"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "“Guaranteed high profit with no risk” is almost certainly a **scam**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": [],
        "cards": [],
        "shuffle": false
      },
      "tasks": []
    },
    {
      "id": "l2",
      "kind": "lesson",
      "title": "Warning signs",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "Warning signs"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "image": "obrazki/2-sygnaly-ostrzegawcze.png",
              "width": 1,
              "maxHeight": 240,
              "caption": ""
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Red flags** are features of an offer that give away a scam. The biggest one: **a high, guaranteed profit with no risk**. Also watch out for:"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "items": [
                "**Time pressure** – “offer valid today only”",
                "**No financial supervision** (KNF, BaFin)",
                "**“Secret algorithms”** instead of facts",
                "A transfer to a **private account** or installing **remote desktop** software"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "text": "Sounds too good to be true? It's a **trap**."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "minigame": {
        "game": "",
        "settings": [],
        "cards": [],
        "shuffle": false
      },
      "tasks": []
